        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: 2015 Clemson Tigers football team, Alabama Crimson Tide football\n- Organizations: Clemson University, NCAA, College Football Playoff\n- Events: 2015 NCAA Division I FBS football season, 2015 Orange Bowl, 2015 Cotton Bowl, 2016 College Football Playoff National Championship\n- Places: University of Phoenix Stadium, Glendale, Arizona\n\nFacts:\n- The 2015 Clemson Tigers football team represented Clemson University in the 2015 NCAA Division I FBS football season.\n- The 82nd Orange Bowl was a College Football Playoff semifinal.\n- The winner of the 2015 Orange Bowl advanced to play the winner of the 2015 Cotton Bowl featuring Alabama Crimson Tide football in the 2016 College Football Playoff National Championship.\n- The 2016 College Football Playoff National Championship took place at University of Phoenix Stadium in Glendale, Arizona.",
